#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "It took them a couple days to take over the world last week, Sarah..."
msgstr "Eles levaram uns dois dias para dominar o mundo na semana passada, Sarah..."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Enforcer"
msgid "It used to be nothing more than a charging plug. Thanks to new sensors however, I prefer the term \"emotional bonding device\"."
msgstr "Antigamente, não passava de um conector de carregamento. No entanto, graças aos novos sensores, prefiro o termo \"dispositivo de vínculo emocional\"."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Leona"
msgid "It was always so soothing... Listening to her purr would remind me of those days... Before everything..."
msgstr "Era sempre tão reconfortante... Ouvir o ronrono dela me lembrava daqueles dias... Antes de tudo..."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "It was an accident! I just fell..."
msgstr "Foi um acidente! Eu só caí..."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "It was nothing. I had a good time."
msgstr "Não foi nada. Eu me diverti bastante."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Leona"
msgid "It was when I moved into the place I'm at now, dear. About a year ago. There were a few... well- unsavory people around. I just..."
